[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.738,
    "text": "They hooked people with an easy Stephen Hawking video about black holes."
  },
  {
    "start": 4.188,
    "end": 7.925,
    "text": "Then they handed them a hard science article on the same thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.375,
    "end": 10.867,
    "text": "Cairn knows that move in his own week."
  },
  {
    "start": 11.317,
    "end": 11.94,
    "text": "Spark first."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.39,
    "end": 13.324,
    "text": "Then the wall."
  },
  {
    "start": 13.774,
    "end": 15.02,
    "text": "Tuesday is the video."
  },
  {
    "start": 15.47,
    "end": 16.716,
    "text": "Thursday is the article."
  },
  {
    "start": 17.166,
    "end": 18.723,
    "text": "The topic did not switch."
  },
  {
    "start": 19.173,
    "end": 20.107,
    "text": "The heat did."
  },
  {
    "start": 20.557,
    "end": 22.738,
    "text": "That is the experiment as a desk."
  },
  {
    "start": 23.188,
    "end": 24.434,
    "text": "You get the calling."
  },
  {
    "start": 24.884,
    "end": 26.441,
    "text": "Then you get the homework."
  },
  {
    "start": 26.891,
    "end": 30.628,
    "text": "The researchers did not invent a hobbyist who picked pottery and quit."
  },
  {
    "start": 31.078,
    "end": 34.816,
    "text": "They built a spark, then a wall, and they watched who stayed."
  },
  {
    "start": 35.266,
    "end": 36.512,
    "text": "The find group cooled."
  },
  {
    "start": 36.962,
    "end": 38.208,
    "text": "The grow group stayed."
  },
  {
    "start": 38.658,
    "end": 43.018,
    "text": "You take some time, you hit a wall, over time you build that commitment."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.468,
    "end": 46.583,
    "text": "That is the story Cairn needs on a cold Thursday."
  },
  {
    "start": 47.033,
    "end": 47.967,
    "text": "Not a fable."
  },
  {
    "start": 48.417,
    "end": 49.04,
    "text": "A pattern."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.49,
    "end": 54.785,
    "text": "People who thought interest is found treated the hard page as evidence they had the wrong topic."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.235,
    "end": 59.595,
    "text": "People who thought interest is grown treated the hard page as the next hour."
  },
  {
    "start": 60.045,
    "end": 60.668,
    "text": "Same Hawking."
  },
  {
    "start": 61.118,
    "end": 61.741,
    "text": "Same article."
  },
  {
    "start": 62.191,
    "end": 62.814,
    "text": "Different theory."
  },
  {
    "start": 63.264,
    "end": 63.887,
    "text": "Different heat."
  },
  {
    "start": 64.337,
    "end": 66.206,
    "text": "Cairn stays for the hard page."
  },
  {
    "start": 66.656,
    "end": 70.082,
    "text": "He does not hunt a new video to feel Tuesday again."
  },
  {
    "start": 70.532,
    "end": 73.335,
    "text": "The wall is not a sign to switch lives."
  },
  {
    "start": 73.785,
    "end": 76.9,
    "text": "The wall is where the grow group did their work."
  },
  {
    "start": 77.35,
    "end": 80.153,
    "text": "Cairn walks it once more so the picture sticks."
  },
  {
    "start": 80.603,
    "end": 81.226,
    "text": "Easy video."
  },
  {
    "start": 81.676,
    "end": 82.299,
    "text": "Hard article."
  },
  {
    "start": 82.749,
    "end": 83.683,
    "text": "Find group cools."
  },
  {
    "start": 84.133,
    "end": 85.067,
    "text": "Grow group stays."
  },
  {
    "start": 85.517,
    "end": 86.763,
    "text": "The spark is allowed."
  },
  {
    "start": 87.213,
    "end": 88.459,
    "text": "The wall is required."
  },
  {
    "start": 88.909,
    "end": 94.204,
    "text": "If he only keeps the work that feels like a calling, he will only keep the trailer."
  },
  {
    "start": 94.654,
    "end": 96.211,
    "text": "The essay is the article."
  },
  {
    "start": 96.661,
    "end": 98.219,
    "text": "The session is the article."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.669,
    "end": 100.226,
    "text": "He sits with the article."
  },
  {
    "start": 100.676,
    "end": 102.856,
    "text": "He lets the Hawking warmth be real."
  },
  {
    "start": 103.306,
    "end": 105.798,
    "text": "Then he lets the hard page be real."
  },
  {
    "start": 106.248,
    "end": 109.362,
    "text": "He does not use the second to cancel the first."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.812,
    "end": 113.55,
    "text": "That is what staying looks like when nobody is filming a calling."
  }
]
